hidden mb-10 shadow-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L10\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/illustrations/cover-02.jpg\",\"alt\":\"How to Commission Custom Illustration Art Online\",\"fill\":true,\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 800px\",\"className\":\"object-cover\",\"priority\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Not every commission starts with an album or a manga chapter. Sometimes you just want a piece — a character portrait, a personal avatar, concept art for a project that isn't fully defined yet, or a gift for someone. Custom illustration is one of the most flexible things you can commission, and also one of the easiest to get wrong if you go in without a plan.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Here's how to commission custom illustration online, from figuring out what you actually want to receiving the final file.\"]}],[\"$\",\"hr\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"What Counts as \\\"Custom Illustration\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Unlike album covers or manga covers, which have fairly fixed formats, custom illustration covers a wide range of requests:\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Character portraits\"}],\" — original characters, D&D characters, personal avatars\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Concept art\"}],\" — early visual development for a game, comic, or story before anything else exists\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Fan art commissions\"}],\" — a specific character from an existing work, done in the artist's style\"]}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\",\"$L20\",\"$L21\",\"$L22\",\"$L23\",\"$L24\",\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\",\"$L29\",\"$L2a\",\"$L2b\",\"$L2c\",\"$L2d\",\"$L2e\",\"$L2f\",\"$L30\",\"$L31\",\"$L32\",\"$L33\",\"$L34\",\"$L35\",\"$L36\",\"$L37\",\"$L38\",\"$L39\",\"$L3a\",\"$L3b\",\"$L3c\",\"$L3d\",\"$L3e\",\"$L3f\"]}],\"$L40\"]}]}],\"$L41\",\"$L42\"]}]\n43:I[87879,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n11:[\"$\",\"li\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Gift commissions\"}],\" — art of a person, pet, or scene for someone else\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"li\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Promotional/key art\"}],\" — a single striking piece used for marketing rather than a specific product cover\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Because the category is broad, being specific about \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"italic text-[var(--yellow)]\",\"children\":\"which\"}],\" of these you want is the first thing that determines price, timeline, and which artist is actually the right fit.\"]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n15:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 1: Figure Out What You're Actually Asking For\"}]\n16:[\"$\",\"p\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Before contacting an artist, answer these for yourself:\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"li\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Is this a \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"finished, standalone piece\"}],\", or an early step in a larger project (like concept art before a full cover)?\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"li\",\"25\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Does it need to match an \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"existing visual style\"}],\" — your own brand, a game's art direction, a series you're building?\"]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"li\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"What's the \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"end use\"}],\"? Personal, print, commercial, social media — usage matters for both pricing and rights.\"]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Artists often quote differently for personal-use pieces versus commercial ones, so being upfront about intended use avoids a renegotiation later.\"]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 2: Build References Even for an Open-Ended Piece\"}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Even a loosely defined commission benefits enormously from references. Bring:\"]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"li\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"2–3 pieces (any artist, any style) that capture the mood or energy you want\"]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"37\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Any fixed details that must be included — specific colors, objects, a character's known appearance\"]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"li\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"A rough sense of composition: portrait, full scene, close-up\"]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"p\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Illustrators who also work across album covers and manga — such as Jhay Sanyay — bring the same structured process to open-ended illustration work, so a clear reference set still gets you a fast, accurate quote even without a fixed format.\"]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n23:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 3: What Custom Illustration Typically Costs\"}]\n24:[\"$\",\"p\",\"46\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Because scope varies more here than in fixed-format work, expect pricing to scale with:\"]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",\"table-54\",{\"className\":\"overflow-x-auto my-8 border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full text-left border-collapse font-mono text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] font-bold\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Factor\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Effect on Price\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Number of characters\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Each additional character adds cost\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Background complexity\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Simple/no background is cheaper than a full scene\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Detail level\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Flat color vs. full rendering/lighting changes turnaround and price\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Commercial usage rights\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Commercial licensing typically costs more than personal use\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"p\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Turnaround for a single-character illustration is often 3–10 days depending on complexity; multi-character scenes can take 2+ weeks.\"]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n28:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"59\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 4: What to Look for in an Illustrator\"}]\n29:[\"$\",\"li\",\"61\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Range across the type of work you want\"}],\" — a portfolio full of covers doesn't always mean strong standalone character work, and vice versa; look for actual examples close to your ask\"]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"li\",\"62\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"A clear commission/booking process\"}],\" — reduces ambiguity on price, timeline, and revisions\"]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"li\",\"63\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Willingness to do a sketch-approval stage\"}],\" — critical for open-ended pieces where composition isn't fixed yet\"]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"li\",\"64\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Clarity on usage rights upfront\"}],\" — personal vs. commercial use should be discussed before, not after, delivery\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"66\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"68\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 5: The Process, Start to Finish\"}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"70\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Brief submission\"}],\" — references, intended use, any fixed details\"]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"li\",\"71\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Quote and scope confirmation\"}],\" — price and timeline based on complexity\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"li\",\"72\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Sketch stage\"}],\" — rough composition for approval\"]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"li\",\"73\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Rendering\"}],\" — full linework, color, and detail pass\"]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"li\",\"74\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Revisions\"}],\" — within agreed rounds\"]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"li\",\"75\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Final delivery\"}],\" — high-resolution file(s) in the format you need\"]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"p\",\"77\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"This is close to the same structure used for album and manga cover commissions — Jhay's \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"commission page\"}],\" runs illustration work through this same brief-to-delivery flow, which keeps open-ended pieces from turning into open-ended timelines.\"]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"79\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n37:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"81\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Common Mistakes\"}]\n38:[\"$\",\"li\",\"83\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Being too open-ended in the brief\"}],\" — \\\"surprise me\\\" sounds fun but usually leads to more revisions, not fewer\"]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"li\",\"84\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Not clarifying usage rights\"}],\" — assuming personal-use pricing covers commercial use (or the reverse) causes friction later\"]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"li\",\"85\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Skipping the sketch-approval step\"}],\" — especially risky on illustration work since composition isn't fixed the way a cover format is\"]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"li\",\"86\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Underestimating multi-character pricing\"}],\" — each added character is realistically its own piece of work, not a minor add-on\"]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"88\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"90\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Final Thoughts\"}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"92\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Custom illustration is the most flexible type of commission, which is exactly why it needs the most upfront clarity — on scope, usage, and references — to go smoothly. A good brief and a clear process turn an open-ended idea into a piece that actually matches what you had in mind.\"]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"94\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"If you're looking to commission custom illustration, character art, or concept work, \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio\"}],\" takes on illustration commissions alongside album and manga cover work, with a structured process from brief to final delivery.\"]}]\n40:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 p-8 bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--ink)] shadow-[10px_10px_0_var(--red)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\",\"children\":\"Ready to Commission?\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase mb-3\",\"children\":\"Get Your Custom Artwork Stamped\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-sans text-[var(--muted)] mb-6\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio handles custom cover art, manga/comic illustrations, and logo design from brief submission to final delivery. Fill out your job ticket below for a 48-hour quote.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#order\",\"className\":\"stamp-btn inline-block !py-3 !px-6\",\"children\":\"FILL OUT 