 first thing that determines price, timeline, and which artist is actually the right fit.\"]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n9:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 1: Figure Out What You're Actually Asking For\"}]\na:[\"$\",\"p\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Before contacting an artist, answer these for yourself:\"]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"li\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Is this a \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"finished, standalone piece\"}],\", or an early step in a larger project (like concept art before a full cover)?\"]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"li\",\"25\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Does it need to match an \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"existing visual style\"}],\" — your own brand, a game's art direction, a series you're building?\"]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"li\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"What's the \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"end use\"}],\"? Personal, print, commercial, social media — usage matters for both pricing and rights.\"]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"p\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Artists often quote differently for personal-use pieces versus commercial ones, so being upfront about intended use avoids a renegotiation later.\"]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n10:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 2: Build References Even for an Open-Ended Piece\"}]\n11:[\"$\",\"p\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Even a loosely defined commission benefits enormously from references. Bring:\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"li\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"2–3 pieces (any artist, any style) that capture the mood or energy you want\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"li\",\"37\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Any fixed details that must be included — specific colors, objects, a character's known appearance\"]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"li\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"A rough sense of composition: portrait, full scene, close-up\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"p\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Illustrators who also work across album covers and manga — such as Jhay Sanyay — bring the same structured process to open-ended illustration work, so a clear reference set still gets you a fast, accurate quote even without a fixed format.\"]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n17:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 3: What Custom Illustration Typically Costs\"}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"46\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Because scope varies more here than in fixed-format work, expect pricing to scale with:\"]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"div\",\"table-54\",{\"className\":\"overflow-x-auto my-8 border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full text-left border-collapse font-mono text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] font-bold\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Factor\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Effect on Price\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Number of characters\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Each additional character adds cost\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Background complexity\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Simple/no background is cheaper than a full scene\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Detail level\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Flat color vs. full rendering/lighting changes turnaround and price\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Commercial usage rights\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Commercial licensing typically costs more than personal use\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Turnaround for a single-character illustration is often 3–10 days depending on complexity; multi-character scenes can take 2+ weeks.\"]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"59\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 4: What to Look for in an Illustrator\"}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"li\",\"61\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Range across the type of work you want\"}],\" — a portfolio full of covers doesn't always mean strong standalone character work, and vice versa; look for actual examples close to your ask\"]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"li\",\"62\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"A clear commission/booking process\"}],\" — reduces ambiguity on price, timeline, and revisions\"]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"63\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Willingness to do a sketch-approval stage\"}],\" — critical for open-ended pieces where composition isn't fixed yet\"]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"li\",\"64\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Clarity on usage rights upfront\"}],\" — personal vs. commercial use should be discussed before, not after, delivery\"]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"66\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n22:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"68\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 5: The Process, Start to Finish\"}]\n23:[\"$\",\"li\",\"70\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Brief submission\"}],\" — references, intended use, any fixed details\"]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"li\",\"71\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Quote and scope confirmation\"}],\" — price and timeline based on complexity\"]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"li\",\"72\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Sketch stage\"}],\" — rough composition for approval\"]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"li\",\"73\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Rendering\"}],\" — full linework, color, and detail pass\"]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"li\",\"74\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Revisions\"}],\" — within agreed rounds\"]}]\n28:[\"$\",\"li\",\"75\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Final delivery\"}],\" — high-resolution file(s) in the format you need\"]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"p\",\"77\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"This is close to the same structure used for album and manga cover commissions — Jhay's \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"commission page\"}],\" runs illustration work through this same brief-to-delivery flow, which keeps open-ended pieces from turning into open-ended timelines.\"]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"79\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"81\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Common Mistakes\"}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"li\",\"83\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Being too open-ended in the brief\"}],\" — \\\"surprise me\\\" sounds fun but usually leads to more revisions, not fewer\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"li\",\"84\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Not clarifying usage rights\"}],\" — assuming personal-use pricing covers commercial use (or the reverse) causes friction later\"]}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"li\",\"85\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Skipping the sketch-approval step\"}],\" — especially risky on illustration work since composition isn't fixed the way a cover format is\"]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"86\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Underestimating multi-character pricing\"}],\" — each added character is realistically its own piece of work, not a minor add-on\"]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"88\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n31:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"90\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Final Thoughts\"}]\n32:[\"$\",\"p\",\"92\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Custom illustration is the most flexible type of commission, which is exactly why it needs the most upfront clarity — on scope, usage, and references — to go smoothly. A good brief and a clear process turn an open-ended idea into a piece that actually matches what you had in mind.\"]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"p\",\"94\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"If you're looking to commission custom illustration, character art, or concept work, \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio\"}],\" takes on illustration commissions alongside album and manga cover work, with a structured process from brief to final delivery.\"]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 p-8 bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--ink)] shadow-[10px_10px_0_var(--red)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\",\"children\":\"Ready to Commission?\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase mb-3\",\"children\":\"Get Your Custom Artwork Stamped\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-sans text-[var(--muted)] mb-6\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio handles custom cover art, manga/comic illustrations, and logo design from brief submission to final delivery. Fill out your job ticket below for a 48